<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:20:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>套利平仓导致墨西哥比索出现 2021 年以来最严重连跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/mexican-peso-sees-worst-losing-streak-since-2021-on-carry-unwind</link><description>随着投资者纷纷转向避险资产以及流行的套利交易瓦解，墨西哥比索正面临五年来最长的连续下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/mexican-peso-sees-worst-losing-streak-since-2021-on-carry-unwind'&gt;套利平仓导致墨西哥比索出现 2021 年以来最严重连跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Mexican Peso in Worst Losing Streak in Years on Carry Unwind&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/mexican-peso-sees-worst-losing-streak-since-2021-on-carry-unwind</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:07:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>AI 溃败使 Kioxia 成为日本最便宜的蓝筹股，支持多头</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ai-rout-makes-kioxia-japan-s-cheapest-blue-chip-backing-bulls</link><description>由于担心人工智能繁荣的可持续性，铠侠控股公司(Kioxia Holdings Corp.)惨遭抛售，使其成为最便宜的日本蓝筹股，强化了分析师的看涨预期。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ai-rout-makes-kioxia-japan-s-cheapest-blue-chip-backing-bulls'&gt;AI 溃败使 Kioxia 成为日本最便宜的蓝筹股，支持多头&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：AI Rout Makes Kioxia Japan’s Cheapest Blue Chip, Backing Bulls&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ai-rout-makes-kioxia-japan-s-cheapest-blue-chip-backing-bulls</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:30:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>欧元今年兑人民币汇率将出现二十年来最大跌幅</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/euro-set-for-biggest-drop-in-two-decades-against-yuan-this-year</link><description>欧元兑人民币汇率将出现二十年来最大年度跌幅，欧洲官员呼吁中国让人民币进一步升值，以抑制进口激增。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/euro-set-for-biggest-drop-in-two-decades-against-yuan-this-year'&gt;欧元今年兑人民币汇率将出现二十年来最大跌幅&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Euro Set for Biggest Drop in Two Decades Against Yuan This Year&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/euro-set-for-biggest-drop-in-two-decades-against-yuan-this-year</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着租金创下新高，银行家们纷纷出钱购买香港公寓</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bankers-pay-up-for-hong-kong-apartments-as-rents-hit-new-highs</link><description>香港蓬勃发展的租赁房地产市场正在刺激以前被低估的社区的收益，因为银行家在世界上最昂贵的居住地之一支付公寓费用。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bankers-pay-up-for-hong-kong-apartments-as-rents-hit-new-highs'&gt;随着租金创下新高，银行家们纷纷出钱购买香港公寓&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bankers Pay Up for Hong Kong Apartments as Rents Hit New Highs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bankers-pay-up-for-hong-kong-apartments-as-rents-hit-new-highs</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</link><description>由于中东能源基础设施和油轮遭受袭击引发了人们对敌对行动升级的担忧，油价本月首次出现周度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27'&gt;11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 27&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:05:38 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>